+## Testing Async Code
+
+### Async Tests with pytest-asyncio
+
+```python
+import pytest
+
+@pytest.mark.asyncio
+async def test_async_function():
+    """Test async function."""
+    result = await async_add(2, 3)
+    assert result == 5
+
